@startuml Kelola_Pesanan_Admin
!theme plain
title Sequence Diagram: Kelola Pesanan/Transaksi (Manage Orders) - Admin
actor Admin
participant "Mobile App\n(Flutter)" as App
participant "Backend\nAPI" as API
database "Database" as DB

Admin -> App: Login sebagai Admin
App -> App: Set Admin Session
App --> Admin: Tampilkan Admin Dashboard

Admin -> App: Klik Menu Kelola Pesanan
App -> API: GET /api/admin/orders
API -> DB: Query All Orders (dengan Filters)
DB --> API: Return Order List
API --> App: Response JSON (Order List)
App --> Admin: Tampilkan Daftar Pesanan\n(Order ID, Customer, Status, Total, Tanggal)

alt View Order Details
    Admin -> App: Klik Salah Satu Pesanan
    App -> API: GET /api/admin/orders/{order_id}
    API -> DB: Query Order Detail dengan Items
    DB --> API: Return Order Data (Items, Customer, Payment, Status)
    API --> App: Response Order Detail
    App --> Admin: Tampilkan Detail Pesanan\n(Items, Customer Info, Payment Method, Status Timeline)

else Filter/Search Orders
    Admin -> App: Input Filter (Status, Date Range, Customer)
    App -> API: GET /api/admin/orders?status={status}&date_from={date}&date_to={date}
    API -> DB: Query Orders dengan Filter
    DB --> API: Return Filtered Order List
    API --> App: Response Filtered List
    App --> Admin: Refresh Daftar dengan Filter Applied

else Update Order Status
    Admin -> App: Klik Order untuk Update Status
    App --> Admin: Tampilkan Status Options (Pending, Confirmed, Shipped, Delivered, Cancelled)

    Admin -> App: Pilih Status Baru
    App -> API: PUT /api/admin/orders/{order_id}/status
    note right of App
        Request Body:
        - status
        - notes (optional)
        - assigned_kurir_id (if shipped)
    end note

    API -> DB: Update Order Status
    API -> DB: Create Status History Entry
    DB --> API: Success

    alt Status = Shipped
        API -> API: Generate Tracking Number
        API -> DB: Update with Tracking Info
        DB --> API: Success
        API --> App: Response (New Status, Tracking Number)
    else Other Status
        API --> App: Response (New Status Updated)
    end

    App --> Admin: Tampilkan Success "Status pesanan diperbarui"

else Cancel Order
    Admin -> App: Klik Tombol Cancel Order
    App --> Admin: Tampilkan Confirmation dengan Reason Field

    Admin -> App: Input Alasan Pembatalan & Confirm
    App -> API: PUT /api/admin/orders/{order_id}/cancel
    note right of App
        Request Body:
        - reason
        - refund_amount
        - admin_id
    end note

    API -> DB: Check if Already Shipped
    alt Order Not Yet Shipped
        API -> DB: Update Order Status = CANCELLED
        API -> DB: Process Refund (if needed)
        DB --> API: Success
        API --> App: Response (Cancelled, Refund Info)
        App --> Admin: Tampilkan Success "Pesanan dibatalkan\nRefund diproses"
    else Already Shipped
        API --> App: Response 409 (Cannot cancel)
        App --> Admin: Tampilkan Error "Pesanan tidak dapat dibatalkan\n(sudah dikirim)"
    end
end

@enduml
